OL,3,GNEWSAMeeting called to discuss future
OL,4,Aof fire-hit mill
OL,5,
OL,6,FPeople evacuated from their homes after
OL,7,Fthe most recent fire at a derelict mill
OL,8,Fcomplex have been invited to a meeting
OL,9,Fto discuss the future of the site.
OL,11,FThe latest in a series of fires tore
OL,12,Fthrough the Grade II* listed Dalton
OL,13,FMills, in Keighley, on 13 September,
OL,14,Fforcing nearby residents from their
OL,15,Fhomes.
OL,17,FOrganised by Keighley and Ilkley MP
OL,18,FRobbie Moore, the meeting is due to
OL,19,Ftake place at Keighley College at 18:00
OL,20,FBST.
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,382,380,200,160,0,100
