OL,3,GNEWSAMeeting called to discuss future
OL,4,Aof fire-hit mill
OL,5,
OL,6,FMeanwhile, in a letter to Bradford
OL,7,FCouncil's chief executive, Keighley
OL,8,FCentral councillor Rebecca Firth
OL,9,Faccused the authority of failing to
OL,10,Fact, saying she had witnessed the
OL,11,F"devastation, panic and fear" caused.
OL,12,FThe council has been approached for
OL,13,Fcomment.
